      <h1 class="pp-title">my digital home</h1>
      <p class="pp-body">This project reimagines everyday technology as an intentional, gamified tool that helps users organize and focus on real-life goals instead of fueling distraction or isolation.</p>
      <p class="pp-body">I wanted to design something that makes people feel more motivated to work to achieve their dreams, while maintaining social connections and managing daily life. I did a deep dive into 2000's tech, dumbphones, phone addiction, gamification, and Pokemon Go to reach my design conclusion.</p>
    </div>
