  <section class="pp-motives">
    <div class="pp-motives-left">
      <div class="pp-motive-item">
        <span class="pp-motive-num">01.</span>
        <p class="pp-body">58% of Gen Z is trying to reduce their social media usage. Smartphones are a catalyst; they encourage passive consumption, isolation, and addiction through endless apps and short-form content.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pp-motive-item">
        <span class="pp-motive-num">02.</span>
        <p class="pp-body">Many have opted for a dumbphone instead, which often doesn't last long. Dumbphones reduce screen time, but fail to replace motivation, structure, or social connection.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pp-motive-item">
        <span class="pp-motive-num">03.</span>
        <p class="pp-body">On the flip side, Pokémon Go successfully motivated outdoor activity and spontaneous in-person interaction through gamification. Care-based and habit-building games have proven that visual progress and responsibility drive long-term behavior change.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-motives-right">
      <div class="pp-img-standard">
        <img src="/projects/my-digital-home/content/graphic.jpg" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

