  <section class="pp-image-text">
    <div class="pp-img-standard pp-img-large">
      <img src="/projects/my-digital-home/content/prototypes.jpg" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class="pp-text-image-right">
      <div style="height: 5vh"></div>
      <p class="pp-body">After testing foam prototypes for the physical form, I landed on the sliding prototype, because it:</p>
      <p class="pp-body">
        ✦ keeps the primary features handy when closed<br>
        ✦ keeps the keyboard tucked away until you need it<br>
        ✦ maximizes space for the screen and keyboard<br>
        ✦ it's fun
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pp-text-image">
    <div class="pp-text-image-left">
      <div style="height: 5vh"></div>
      <p class="pp-body">I kept the controls to what people already recognize, which is why I chose a D-pad and a few simple buttons.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-img-standard">
      <img src="/projects/my-digital-home/content/labeled.jpg" alt="">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pp-image-text">
